        "cooked": "<p>I hope I don't come off as spamming but...</p><p>If anyone is down for doing Sentinel over the weekend I'm game. Next week, I'll be back in town with all my new stuff and ready to roll out a real game (no more expansion only stuff). I'll help run games and such and try to actually do something instead of die (Cosmic Omnitron, the thing that just gets Electro pulse in 5 rounds or less.). Either way, message me if you want to play, webcams are optional.</p>",
